       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Daily total:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. The maximum labeled dose for adults is 3,200 mg/day under medical supervision. Over-the-counter use is limited to 1,200 mg/day.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is double the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n\nA dose this high raises the risk of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n- **400\u2013800 mg by mouth, 3 times daily**, which is typical for pain or inflammation\n- **1600 mg per day in total**, for example 400 mg 4 times daily\n\nIf you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that it's intentional and give the clinical rationale. I can then enter it with a note, though pharmacy will probably want to review it. Tell me which dose you'd like and I'll enter it."
